    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>ButtonSpinner combines an input-like content area with increment and decrement handles, and supports add-ons, prefixes, suffixes, statuses, sizes, and visual variants.</source>
        <target state="translated">ButtonSpinner 將輸入式內容區與遞增/遞減按鈕結合，支持前後置標籤、內部前後綴、狀態、尺寸和視覺形態。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>A compact spinner input with button handles.</source>
        <target state="translated">帶按鈕操作柄的緊湊微調輸入控件。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
